figures are generated by
construct_odometer/annotated_tiles/gen_figs.jl

they represent all the possible tile orientations and overlaps 
in both the standard case and the alternate case 

even-first orientation e_*
odd-first o_*

even tile _*q, odd tile _*q

type i\in{1,2,3} child *i*

the notation for the subtiles is as the written document
